# Demo gold set — questions for the committed demo corpus (data/articles_demo/).
#
# Format: one JSON object per line:
#   {"question": "...", "expected_chunk_ids": ["<doc_id>#<chunk_index>", ...]}
# An empty expected_chunk_ids list marks a refusal case (the corpus should not answer it).
#
# Question types: per-article factual, multi-source (facts split across two
# documents), disagreement (Mira Chen vs. a company post), near-duplicate
# stress (sibling chunks that a reranker can confuse), and refusal bait
# (topics the corpus mentions but never explains).

# --- relay-systems/arbiter-double-refund-postmortem ---
{"question": "what caused Arbiter to issue duplicate refunds?", "expected_chunk_ids": ["companies/relay-systems/arbiter-double-refund-postmortem#1", "companies/relay-systems/arbiter-double-refund-postmortem#0"]}
